Omitting `sessionIds` on `delete-batch` means "delete every archived session".

```ts
interface ArchivedSession {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  cwd?: string;

---

`delete-batch` 不传 `sessionIds` 时，等价于「删除全部已归档会话」。

```ts
interface ArchivedSession {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  cwd?: string;

---
